    "q": "<p>Which items would be included in the cash flows from investing activities?</p><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">a)</span><div><span>Proceeds on sale of property, plant and equipment</span></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">b)</span><div><span>Purchase of subsidiary undertaking</span></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">c)</span><div><span>Issue of share capital at premium</span></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">d)</span><div><span>Dividends paid to non-controlling interests</span></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">e)</span><div><span>Payments to acquire property, plant and equipment</span></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">f)</span><div><span>Purchase of investments</span></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">g)</span><div><span>Net proceeds from long-term borrowing</span></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">h)</span><div><span>Dividends paid</span></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">i)</span><div><span>Dividends received from associate</span></div></div>",
    "a": "<p class=\"answer-key\">The correct answer is a, b, e, f, and i.</p><p class=\"answer-key\">The correct answers reflect items that would be included under cash flow from investing activities.</p>",
